SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT License above applies only to source code in this repository
(for example `scripts/`, `.github/`, and other software files) and its
technical documentation.

It does NOT apply to Roger Wilco Imagery outputs, including SITREPs,
reports, analysis, detections, counts, flags, alerts, baselines, maps,
processed or annotated imagery, benchmarks, and provenance manifests
(for example the contents of `reports/`, `data/`, `proofs/` and
`benchmarks/`). Those are governed by the Roger Wilco Imagery Terms of Use
in `docs/TERMS.md`, which provide free non-commercial use for journalists
and students and require a licence for commercial use.

Third-party data in this repository (including Copernicus Sentinel,
NASA, USGS, OpenStreetMap, ADS-B and AIS data, and databases derived
from them such as `data/osm/` and `data/adsb_history/`) remains under its
original licence. Databases derived from OpenStreetMap or adsb.lol data
are available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL).

This scope statement applies from 25 October 2026.
